flowchart LR
    RUN[Claimed AIRun] --> FP[Load context and fingerprint]
    FP --> ROUTER[Router step]
    ROUTER --> TARGET{Specialist selection mode}
    TARGET -->|fixed| SPECIALIST[Specialist step]
    TARGET -->|auto| SELECTOR[Selector step]
    SELECTOR --> SPECIALIST
    TARGET -->|none| HANDOFF[Human handoff]
    SPECIALIST --> TRANSPORT{Persistent conversations enabled?}
    TRANSPORT -->|no| EXEC[Ephemeral codex exec]
    TRANSPORT -->|yes| PERSIST[Persistent specialist adapter]
    PERSIST --> APP_SERVER{App-server transport enabled?}
    APP_SERVER -->|no| PEXEC[Persistent codex exec]
    APP_SERVER -->|yes| STDIO[Run-scoped app-server stdio]
    STDIO --> STEER{Active steering enabled?}
    STEER -->|yes| CUSTODY[Strict unseen steer receipts]
    STEER -->|no| FENCE[turn/completed fence]
    CUSTODY --> FENCE
    EXEC --> POLICY[Validate publication policy]
    PEXEC --> POLICY
    FENCE --> POLICY
    POLICY -->|auto_publish| PUBLIC[Public reply and succeeded]
    POLICY -->|draft_for_human| DRAFT[Draft and human_review]
    POLICY -->|manual_only| HUMAN[Internal note and human_review]
